      explanation: "Chen tr\u1EC5 b\u1EBFn ph\u1EE5 m\u1ED9t ng\xE0y."
      quote: "C\u1EA3ng ph\u1EE5 n\xE0y... l\xE0 c\u1EA3ng ph\u1EE5 g\xEC?"
